     5| * OPERATIONS. This is a read-only aggregation + derivation layer over the
     6| * engines already shipped (business-impact, capital command center,
     7| * autonomous-core, task orchestrator) — it never mutates and never fabricates.
     8| *
     9| * It produces, from real subsystem state, the six executive surfaces the owner
    10| * asked for:
    11| *   1. Daily business briefing — revenue, CRM pipeline, investor pipeline,
