    42|const EXECUTIVE_DISCLAIMER =
    43|  'Executive operations reporting only — every figure is derived from real IVX records. ' +
    44|  'Revenue/upside figures are POTENTIAL pipeline value, never guaranteed. Cash runway requires ' +
    45|  'burn/expense data IVX does not yet track. Not financial, investment, or legal advice.';
    46|
    47|// ── Public types ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
